## Project Structure

```
src/
├── app/
│   ├── App.tsx                  # Root component
│   ├── routes.ts                # React Router configuration
│   ├── api/
│   │   └── services.ts          # ALL data functions (single source of truth)
│   └── components/
│       ├── LandingPage.tsx
│       ├── LoginPage.tsx
│       ├── Dashboard.tsx
│       ├── FinancePage.tsx
│       └── dashboard/
│           ├── DocumentHandler.tsx
│           ├── ReportHandler.tsx
│           ├── ClinicHandler.tsx
│           ├── TreasurerHandler.tsx
│           └── SuperAdmin.tsx
├── styles/
│   ├── theme.css               # Brand colors (Navy, Teal, Smoke White)
│   ├── fonts.css               # Montserrat + Inter
│   └── index.css               # Global styles
├── SQL_SCHEMA.sql              # Full database schema for Django
├── DJANGO_INTEGRATION_GUIDE.md # Complete Django setup guide
└── BACKEND_QUICKSTART.md       # Quick-start for backend developers
```

---

## Django Backend Integration

All data currently uses `localStorage` as temporary storage.
To connect a real Django backend, edit only **one file**: `src/app/api/services.ts`

See [`src/BACKEND_QUICKSTART.md`](./src/BACKEND_QUICKSTART.md) for step-by-step instructions.

